Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:36:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PC5: a crash report in the log (Wine patch 0912)

The console runs no debugger, so a game's unhandled crash left only its
kind and the faulting address: not which of the game's code led to it.
Wine now logs the faulting thread's registers, where it faulted and the
code addresses on its stack, each as module+offset.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W9bbTPMqftZ2Yv6sJzUsWv
